  "description": "Yoon Hee-Soo, is an illegitimate son of Dayoon Group, a leading conglomerate in Korea. \n\n\"From now on, I'll be in charge of your moral education.\"\n\"...\"\n\"Nobody cares.\"\n\nHee-Soo struggles to escape Kang Joo-Chan, the secretary who controls him and monitors his every move. For the past 10 years, they have tamed each other and been together that way.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
